#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tileop/gemm_blockscaled/gemm_blockscaled_base/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Mixed into a dense backend implementation class (``GemmTCGEN5``, "
"``GemmMMA``, ...) whose ``gemm_node`` is a ``GemmBlockScaled``. It owns "
"everything the dense classes must not know about: the SFA/SFB regions, the "
"logical K-axis start and the ``sf_*`` annotations. Which scale layouts a "
"backend supports stays with that backend."
msgstr ""

